<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH LEAGUE SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH LEAGUE SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SEBASTIAN, Spain 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of the Spanish first division soccer match played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Real Sociedad 1 (Agustin Aranzabal 25th min) Deportivo Coruna 1 (Rivaldo, 65th). Halftime 1-0. Attendance 19,000.</p>
